@startuml
title Video Player
left to right direction

actor User

rectangle "Video Player" {
    usecase "Set up\nvideo source" as UC_Setup
    usecase "Select video" as UC_Select
    usecase "Play video" as UC_Play
    usecase "Build video list\nfrom source" as UC_BuildList
}

User -- UC_Setup
User -- UC_Select
User -- UC_Play

UC_Setup ..> UC_BuildList : <<include>>

note right of UC_BuildList
* Search the source recursively
* Find supported video files
* Sort by date in descending order
* Display newest videos first
* Update list automatically
end note

note right of UC_Play
Before playback:
If a saved playback position exists,
resume from that position.

During/after playback:
If any part is played,
mark the video as viewed and
save the playback position.
end note

@enduml